<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html>
    <head>
        <title>Challenge: A picture-perfect trip</title>
        <meta charset="utf-8">
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1>The perfect trip</h1>

<p>I would see scenes like...</p>
<img src="https://www.kasandbox.org/programming-images/landscapes/beach.png" alt="Beach scenery">

<p>And animals like...</p>
<img src="https://www.kasandbox.org/programming-images/animals/cat.png" alt="Cute animal">

<p>And eat food like...</p>
<img src="https://www.kasandbox.org/programming-images/food/pizza.png" alt="Pizza">

        
    </body>
</html>

<!2/2>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <title>Challenge: A picture-perfect trip</title>
        <meta charset="utf-8">
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1>The perfect trip</h1>

        <p>I would see scenes like...</p>
        <img src="https://www.kasandbox.org/programming-images/landscapes/beach.png"
             alt="Beach scenery"
             width="300">

        <p>And animals like...</p>
        <img src="https://www.kasandbox.org/programming-images/animals/cat.png"
             alt="Cute animal"
             width="200">

        <p>And eat food like...</p>
        <img src="https://www.kasandbox.org/programming-images/food/pizza.png"
             alt="Pizza"
             width="200">
    </body>
</html>

